# These files run on Linux (cloud-init, systemd, GitHub runners). Keep LF even on Windows checkouts.
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.service  text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.env      text eol=lf
*.tmpl     text eol=lf
# Everything under cx23/ is copied as a folder to the bot's server (deploy/cx23/README.md), so every
# file there is LF, whatever its type: a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true gave CRLF copies of
# bot.env.example, check-env.mjs and README.md (lead, after GO 2). test/unit/deploy-eol.test.js checks it.
cx23/**    text eol=lf
